Signing material
----------------

tools/debug.keystore is a signing-key container, not an executable tool, and
does not have a software version or license identifier. It is intentionally
excluded from the upstream artifact/license comparison. Private keystores
should not be published unless their use as a public test key is deliberate.

Verification method
-------------------

Versions were obtained from --version/-version output, JAR manifests and
embedded version metadata. Artifact identity was then independently confirmed
by extracting the official Google/Eclipse downloads and comparing SHA-256
digests. A matching filename alone was not treated as proof of identity.
